PREFIX : <http://example/>

## Path where a "connection" must be weight > 5

## Condition for one step in the path.
RULE { ?x :connected ?z } 
WHERE {
     ?x :link ?z {| :weight ?w |}
     FILTER(?w > 5)
}

## Recursion "connected"
RULE { ?x :connected ?y }
WHERE {
    ?x :connected ?z . ?z :connected ?y
}
